  "declaration.title": "Compliance Statement",
  "declaration.subtitle": "PR-AI Assistant — Investigation Mode",
  "declaration.intro": "This artificial intelligence module operates under the following principles:",
  "declaration.p1.title": "ZERO ALTERATION",
  "declaration.p1.text": ": PR-AI Assistant does NOT access, modify or touch the original digital evidence under any circumstances. It works only with data already extracted and hashed by the PRImager forensic modules.",
  "declaration.p2.text": ": The order of volatility and good practices for collecting digital evidence are respected at all times. AI is an ASSISTANCE tool, not a collection tool.",
  "declaration.p3.title": "TRACEABILITY",
  "declaration.p3.text": ": Every interaction with the AI model is recorded with a UTC timestamp, a SHA-256 hash and the identity of the examiner. This record cannot be altered.",
  "declaration.p4.title": "HUMAN VALIDATION",
  "declaration.p4.text": ": No answer from the model constitutes evidence or an expert conclusion. All output must be verified by the examiner before it is included in the report.",
